<div class="card"><h1 class="passage-title">End of Version 0.0.5</h1><p class="sub">Six days at Shape of You Inc. Five transfers, the ethics, legal, and contract modules, the speculum, Diana's call, Lyla with wine and questions &mdash; and one Saturday off to dig out, eat with Tommy, drink with Paco, and stay a little too long at Adriana's bar.</p></div>

